{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "kafka-topics-overview",
  "title": "Kafka Topics Overview",
  "tags": [
    "observability",
    "kafka",
    "redpanda"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Technical Dashboard",
      "url": "/d/quarkus-overview",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Compose Services",
      "url": "/d/compose-services-overview",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Management Dashboard",
      "url": "/d/coffeeshop-management",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "topic",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Topic",
        "hide": 0,
        "datasource": "Prometheus",
        "query": "label_values(vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic!~\"__.*\"}, topic)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": ".*"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "group",
        "type": "query",
        "label": "Consumer Group",
        "hide": 0,
        "datasource": "Prometheus",
        "query": "label_values(vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\"}, group)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": ".*"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Tracked Topics",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (topic) (vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic!~\"__.*\",topic=~\"$topic\"}))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Active Consumer Groups",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count by (group) (vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\",group=~\"$group\"}))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 6,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total Consumer Lag",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(clamp_min(max by (topic,partition) (vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}) - on(topic,partition) group_left(group) max by (topic,partition,group) (vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\",topic=~\"$topic\",group=~\"$group\"}), 0))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Top Lagged Partition",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "max(clamp_min(max by (topic,partition) (vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}) - on(topic,partition) group_left(group) max by (topic,partition,group) (vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\",topic=~\"$topic\",group=~\"$group\"}), 0))",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Records Produced/s by Topic",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(vectorized_cluster_partition_records_produced{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Records Fetched/s by Topic",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(vectorized_cluster_partition_records_fetched{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bytes Produced/s by Topic",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(vectorized_cluster_partition_bytes_produced_total{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Consumer Lag by Topic/Group",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic,group) (clamp_min(max by (topic,partition) (vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}) - on(topic,partition) group_left(group) max by (topic,partition,group) (vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\",topic=~\"$topic\",group=~\"$group\"}), 0))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}} / {{group}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Producer Errors & Retries (App)",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(kafka_producer_topic_record_error_total{job=\"quarkus\",topic=~\"$topic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "errors {{topic}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(kafka_producer_topic_record_retry_total{job=\"quarkus\",topic=~\"$topic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "retries {{topic}}",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top Partition Lag (Topic/Group/Partition)",
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, clamp_min(max by (topic,partition) (vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}) - on(topic,partition) group_left(group) max by (topic,partition,group) (vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\",topic=~\"$topic\",group=~\"$group\"}), 0))",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Kafka-Related Logs (app/redpanda)",
      "datasource": "Loki",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "{service=~\"app|redpanda\"} |~ \"kafka|redpanda|coffee-orders\"",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Kafka-Leitfaden",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Kafka-Monitoring-Leitfaden\n- **Durchsatz**: Produced/Fetched Records und Bytes pro Topic zeigen die Last.\n- **Lag-Risiko**: Total Lag, Lag nach Topic/Group und Top Lagged Partition zeigen Consumer-Verzögerung.\n- **Fehlerkontext**: Producer Errors/Retries und Logs helfen, Broker- von App-Problemen zu trennen.\n- **Fokus**: Nutze Topic-/Group-Variablen, um den Impact-Bereich schnell einzugrenzen."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Produced Record Share by Topic (5m)",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 45,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic) (rate(vectorized_cluster_partition_records_produced{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Current Lag by Topic/Group",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 45,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": "Prometheus",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (topic,group) (clamp_min(max by (topic,partition) (vectorized_cluster_partition_end_offset{job=\"redpanda\",namespace=\"kafka\",topic=~\"$topic\"}) - on(topic,partition) group_left(group) max by (topic,partition,group) (vectorized_kafka_group_offset{job=\"redpanda\",topic=~\"$topic\",group=~\"$group\"}), 0))",
          "legendFormat": "{{topic}} / {{group}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  }
}
